  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social Action for Championing Human Rights in the Philippines</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The action aims to contribute to the support of human rights defenders in the Philippines, working on critical areas of human rights and democracy, such as child rights, indigenous rights and environmental rights. Specifically, it aims to establish structures and programs in 30 arch/dioceses, which actively promote and advocate for the respect of Human Rights in the Philippines and safeguard Human Rights defenders.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
